,"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[20535,1005],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Liyue_71058/Q7105805","priority":5,"questId":71058,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":710580501,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":3097604802,"text":"やっぱり来たわね。好きな場所に座って。","nextNodeIds":[710580502]},{"nodeId":710580502,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":513145314,"text":"ここには…えっと…紅茶はなくなったし…砂糖ももうない…うん、牛乳は、オエッ——もう腐ってる。後で捨てなきゃ…本当にごめんね。","nextNodeIds":[710580503]},{"nodeId":710580503,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":616264474,"text":"でも炎水ならたくさん残ってるわよ…お菓子には硬いクッキーもある、それに酸っぱいジャムも残ってるし…うん、茶会を開くには十分。","nextNodeIds":[710580504]},{"nodeId":710580504,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3059698626,"text":"わぁ…！おまえたちは炎水なんて強い酒で茶会をやってるのか？","nextNodeIds":[710580505]},{"nodeId":710580505,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":3243343618,"text":"そうだけど、変かしら？","nextNodeIds":[710580506,710580508]},{"nodeId":710580506,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":492556258,"text":"えっと…やっぱり遠慮しておくね。","nextNodeIds":[710580507]},{"nodeId":710580507,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":2197914658,"text":"どうしたの？へへ、ここではお酒を飲んだって誰にも何も言われないんだから、畏まらないでね！","nextNodeIds":[710580510,710580511]},{"nodeId":710580510,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4140843106,"text":"何がしたいの？","nextNodeIds":[710580512]},{"nodeId":710580512,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":2093673402,"text":"「適切なタイミングで食べ物と情報を共有することで、質問する人の口を塞ぐことができます。」","nextNodeIds":[710580513]},{"nodeId":710580513,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":1166149522,"text":"…私たちのハンドブックにはそう書いてあるわよ。","nextNodeIds":[710580514]},{"nodeId":710580514,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3989187146,"text":"でも、情報は？","nextNodeIds":[710580515]},{"nodeId":710580515,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":3175930226,"text":"ん？今教えたじゃない。","nextNodeIds":[710580516]},{"nodeId":710580516,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2787572386,"text":"なんだよ…なにか言ったか？","nextNodeIds":[710580517]},{"nodeId":710580517,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":3606571930,"text":"「『ファデュイ先遣隊訓練ハンドブック』付録4-4、第32条：適切なタイミングで食べ物と情報を共有することで、質問する人の口を塞ぐことができます。」って。","nextNodeIds":[710580518]},{"nodeId":710580518,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":3043051570,"text":"命を助けてくれたものね、秘密の訓練ハンドブックの内容まで教えてあげたわよ！ふふん、誠意は十分でしょう？","nextNodeIds":[710580519]},{"nodeId":710580519,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2840390690,"text":"それを知ってなんの役に立つんだよ！","nextNodeIds":[710580520]},{"nodeId":710580520,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":4058105066,"text":"ふふ、冗談はここまでにしましょう…本当に、助けてくれて感謝してるわ。この好意を誤解しないでほしいの。","nextNodeIds":[710580521]},{"nodeId":710580521,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1240282290,"text":"うぅ…おまえらが今までやってきたことを考えると、ファデュイが好意を持ってるなんて信じないぞ…","nextNodeIds":[710580522]},{"nodeId":710580522,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3817121786,"text":"何を企んでるの？","nextNodeIds":[710580523]},{"nodeId":710580523,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":526524218,"text":"外部の人がファデュイの理念を理解できないのは、分かっているわ。でも、理念とか立場を抜きにすれば、私たちも普通の人間だもの。","nextNodeIds":[710580524]},{"nodeId":710580524,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":583725770,"text":"…それに、目的がなんだろうと、私たちは、最後の決戦のために準備をしているだけ。","nextNodeIds":[710580525]},{"nodeId":710580525,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3356039290,"text":"最後の決戦…？","nextNodeIds":[710580526]},{"nodeId":710580526,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":919433466,"text":"ええ、最後に私たちが直面するのは、共通の強大な敵と、逃げ場のない長い夜よ…スネージナヤの国民はみんなこの警告を受け入れたの。","nextNodeIds":[710580527]},{"nodeId":710580527,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":2352253122,"text":"だから、この冷酷な世界のために、人類が流したすべての血と涙は無意味なものじゃない。","nextNodeIds":[710580528]},{"nodeId":710580528,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":1463700538,"text":"乾杯する？ふん、分かった分かった、私が飲むわよ…","nextNodeIds":[710580529,710580531]},{"nodeId":710580529,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":585988290,"text":"悪行を働くことの言い訳をしているの？","nextNodeIds":[710580530]},{"nodeId":710580530,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":666331418,"text":"そうかもね…私は知らないし、気にしてもいないわ。あんたが解釈したいなら、理由を説明してあげないこともない…ただし、それは私なりの理由だから、あんたは気に食わないかもしれない。それだけよ。","nextNodeIds":[710580534]},{"nodeId":710580534,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":86494410,"text":"うぅ…なんでいきなり真面目に話し始めたんだ…","nextNodeIds":[710580535]},{"nodeId":710580535,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":323391890,"text":"ちなみに、私はもう自己紹介をしたわよ。あんたたちの名前はまだ聞いていないけど。","nextNodeIds":[710580536,710580537]},{"nodeId":710580536,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2710767786,"text":"#{NICKNAME}。","nextNodeIds":[710580538]},{"nodeId":710580538,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3988209570,"text":"オイラはパイモン！聞いたことあるよな！","nextNodeIds":[710580539]},{"nodeId":710580539,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":1618517066,"text":"ああ！あんたたちの名前…！","nextNodeIds":[710580540]},{"nodeId":710580540,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2455778498,"text":"ふふんっ！どうだ？きっとテイワット大陸中に轟いてるんだろう、そうだよな！","nextNodeIds":[710580541]},{"nodeId":710580541,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":1092658898,"text":"ごめん、どっちも初耳。","nextNodeIds":[710580542]},{"nodeId":710580542,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4131172978,"text":"え——？","nextNodeIds":[710580543]},{"nodeId":710580543,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":863807410,"text":"気に障ったらごめんね。でも私たちは遥か前からここに配備されたの。補給線から流れてくる情報以外、地上のことはほとんど何も知らない…","nextNodeIds":[710580544]},{"nodeId":710580544,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4189910914,"text":"え…！それってつまり…","nextNodeIds":[710580545]},{"nodeId":710580545,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2685888170,"text":"その補給線がだいぶ前から断たれてた？","nextNodeIds":[710580546]},{"nodeId":710580546,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":2548140434,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[710580547]},{"nodeId":710580547,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":4276110162,"text":"茶会の時間はここまで！私は休むから、ごめんね！","nextNodeIds":[710580548]},{"nodeId":710580548,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":258710898,"text":"おい！まだ何も食べてないぞ！","nextNodeIds":[710580549]},{"nodeId":710580549,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"カタリナ","textMapHash":1485400442,"text":"さっさと出なさいよ！私の炎水に文句言ったくせに！","nextNodeIds":[710580550]},{"nodeId":710580550,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1320839954,"text":"あんなもの、飲めるようなものじゃないだろ！","nextNodeIds":[710580551,710580552]},{"nodeId":710580551,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2369669058,"text":"パイモン、落ち着いて。","nextNodeIds":[710580553]},{"nodeId":710580553,"r